# Stack Rules

- Backend: FastAPI + Pydantic + Pydantic Settings (`APP_` prefix, `SecretStr` for secrets).
- Agents: Pydantic AI (Phase 3+); prompts in YAML under `backend/app/agents/prompts/`.
- Database: PostgreSQL + pgvector.
- Local LLM: separate chat and embedding URLs.
- Frontend: Next.js 14 + TypeScript.
- Observability: Logfire when `APP_LOGFIRE_TOKEN` is set.
- Never hard-code secrets; use `Settings` from `app.core.config`.
